      "message": "docs(process): a review finding keeps the PR ready; no draft round trip\n\nA needs-rework finding no longer turns a ready PR into a draft. The author\npushes the fix to the same PR, and the push voids the earlier review for the\nnew head. An orange conflicts verdict still makes our own PR a draft. The\nfirst needs-rework comment names the class of each finding and asks for one\nrule that closes the class.\n\nData: 30 PRs, 36 ready-to-draft switches, 27 after needs-rework, median 1.6 h.\nOwner order 2026-11-23, recorded in docs/decisions/3727-ready-flag-stays.md.\n\nFixes #3727\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
